      en: ["Geneina is the traditional headquarters of the Masalit Sultanate.", "The city is located approximately 27 kilometers from the Chad-Sudan border.", "It lies along the Wadi Kaja, which provides water for local agriculture.", "Geneina serves as the administrative capital of West Darfur State.", "The Sultan's Palace remains a key symbol of local traditional authority.", "The University of Geneina was established to serve the far western region.", "It is a vital gateway for trade between Sudan and Central African nations.", "The city is situated at an elevation of roughly 800 meters (2,625 ft)."],
